error[O-Temporary]: a returned value cannot borrow a temporary
  --> tests/temporaries/a_value_borrowing_an_inout_temporary_cannot_outlive_its_statement.lin:22:13
   |
22 |     advance(.{ count = 1 })
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this temporary ends with its statement, before the caller reads the result
   |
   = help: return a value that does not borrow it, or borrow a parameter instead
error[O-Temporary]: a value borrowing a temporary is used after the temporary's statement
  --> tests/temporaries/a_value_borrowing_an_inout_temporary_cannot_outlive_its_statement.lin:26:24
   |
26 |     let kept = advance(.{ count = 41 })
   |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this temporary ends with its statement
27 |     UInt8(*kept.value + within() + *leaving().value)
   |           ----------- and a value borrowing it is used here
   |
   = help: bind the value with `var` first, and lend the binding with `&`
